cation":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Glow Express Facial","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=102","description":"A results-driven, 30-minute treatment designed to quickly refresh, smooth, and brighten your complexion. Ideal for busy schedules, lunch breaks, or a pre-event pick-me-up, this targeted service focuses on restoring hydration, radiance, and balance with professional skincare tailored to your skin's immediate needs. Your esthetician will perform a thorough cleanse and gentle exfoliation to remove buildup and dullness, followed by a revitalizing mask to boost glow and replenish moisture. The treatment is completed with toner, a customized serum, eye and lip care, and a hydrating moisturizer with SPF to protect and perfect your skin. You'll leave with a softer, more luminous, and refreshed complexion, all in under half an hour.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=102","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=103","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=103","description":"An advanced, non-surgical treatment designed to deeply nourish, hydrate, and revitalize the skin from within. This facial combines professional-grade skincare with targeted mesotherapy techniques, delivering a customized cocktail of vitamins, antioxidants, hyaluronic acid, and rejuvenating ingredients directly into the superficial layers of the skin. After a thorough cleanse and gentle exfoliation, your esthetician uses precise, micro-delivery methods to infuse these actives where they are needed most, helping to boost collagen, improve elasticity, and support healthy skin function. The result is a smoother, plumper, and more radiant complexion with improved tone and texture, and a visible reduction in dullness and early signs of aging.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=103","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=104","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"120.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Signature Radiance Facial","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=104","description":"A one-hour, results-driven treatment designed to restore your natural glow while deeply relaxing the mind and body. This luxurious service combines rich, sensorial textures with high-performance formulas packed with natural vitamins and antioxidants to nourish, protect, and brighten the skin. Your facial begins with a gentle double cleanse and tone to purify and balance, followed by customized exfoliation to smooth and refine your skin's texture. A targeted treatment mask is then selected to address your unique concerns, whether that's dullness, dehydration, or uneven tone. A relaxing facial massage boosts circulation and radiance, while concentrated serums work to improve the appearance of fine lines and revitalize the complexion. Dedicated eye and lip care soften and hydrate the delicate areas, and a nourishing neck treatment ensures a seamlessly rejuvenated look. Ideal for anyone seeking both visible radiance and deep relaxation.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=104","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=105","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS RF Skin Tightening Facial","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=105","description":"An advanced anti-aging treatment designed to tighten, lift, and rejuvenate the skin. This facial combines targeted skincare with radiofrequency (RF) technology, which gently heats the deeper layers of the skin to stimulate collagen and elastin production without damaging the surface. Your esthetician will cleanse and prepare the skin, then glide the RF device over key areas of the face, focusing on areas prone to laxity such as the cheeks, jawline, and under the chin. As the tissue warms, collagen fibers contract and new collagen is gradually produced, helping to improve firmness, refine contours, and soften the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles over time. Best results seen in a series as part of a customized skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=105","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Microneedling Treatments","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=106","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"180.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Hyaluronic Acid","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=106","description":"A professional treatment designed to stimulate the skin's natural healing process and boost collagen production for smoother, firmer, and more even-looking skin. Using fine, sterile needles, controlled micro-channels activate collagen and elastin renewal while hyaluronic acid is infused as a standard part of every treatment to deeply hydrate and plump the skin. This combination helps improve fine lines, acne scars, stretch marks, and overall skin texture. Best results are achieved with a series of treatments for progressively healthier, more radiant skin.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=106","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=107","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Triple Peptides","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=107","description":"An advanced microneedling service that builds on standard microneedling with hyaluronic acid infusion, enhanced with a professional triple peptide serum featuring three targeted peptides designed to support repair, boost firmness, and smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. As the peptides are infused through freshly created micro-channels, they penetrate more effectively to improve texture, elasticity, and overall radiance. Ideal for those focused on anti-aging and skin rejuvenation, delivering a more lifted, refined, and youthful-looking complexion.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=107","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=108","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Chemical Peel","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=108","description":"An intensified skin rejuvenation treatment pairing standard microneedling and hyaluronic acid infusion with a customized chemical peel selected for your unique skin type and concerns. The peel dissolves dull, damaged surface cells and targets discoloration, congestion, and uneven tone, while microneedling's controlled micro-channels support deeper renewal from within. Together, they help visibly improve fine lines, acne scars, enlarged pores, sun damage, and overall texture for smoother, firmer, more radiant skin. Best performed in a series as part of a personalized skin-rejuvenation plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=108","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=109","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Collagen","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=109","description":"An advanced microneedling service that builds on standard microneedling with hyaluronic acid infusion, enhanced with a concentrated collagen serum designed to support repair, boost firmness, and improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. As the collagen is infused through freshly created micro-channels, it penetrates more effectively to enhance texture, elasticity, and overall radiance. Ideal for anti-aging and skin rejuvenation, delivering a plumper, more lifted, and youthful-looking complexion, especially when performed in a series.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=109","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=110","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"90.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Nanoneedling Lip Infusion","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=110","description":"A luxurious lip treatment designed to deeply hydrate, smooth, and revitalize the lips using advanced nano microneedling technology. This gentle procedure creates micro-channels that enhance the absorption of nourishing ingredients, helping improve lip texture, hydration, and natural fullness. The treatment includes gentle exfoliation, targeted hydration, and a restorative lip mask, leaving lips visibly softer, smoother, and naturally radiant.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=110","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Chemical Peels","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=111","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Enzymatic Glow Peel","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=111","description":"A gentle enzymatic peel using naturally derived fruit enzymes to softly dissolve and lift away dull, dead skin cells from the surface, delivering radiance without harshness. Each treatment is fully customized to your unique skin type, sensitivity level, and concerns, making it an ideal option for even the most delicate or reactive skin. This tailored approach helps brighten dull, tired skin, smooth uneven texture, boost clarity, and enhance hydration while respecting your skin's natural barrier. Perfect when you want an immediate, event-ready glow with little to no downtime and minimal risk of irritation.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=111","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=112","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"120.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Radiant Renewal Chemical Peel","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=112","description":"A customized chemical peel using a curated selection of professional-grade exfoliating acids tailored to your unique skin type, concerns, and sensitivity level. Whether you want to brighten dull skin, smooth uneven texture and fine lines, minimize discoloration and post-acne marks, or help clear congestion and refine pores, your peel will be customized to meet your specific goals. Your esthetician will perform a thorough skin analysis and select the ideal peel solution and strength, taking into account oiliness, dryness, sensitivity, skin tone, and your current skincare routine. With a series of treatments, many guests see more even tone, refined texture, and an overall rejuvenated appearance.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=112","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Exfoliation Treatments","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=113","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Exfoliation","name":"VITALIS Advanced Dermal Resurfacing","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=113","description":"A results-focused treatment combining an express facial with advanced dermabrasion to deeply cleanse, exfoliate, and renew the skin. This treatment removes dead skin cells and impurities while refining texture and restoring luminosity. Your experience includes cleansing, dermabrasion exfoliation, a revitalizing mask, toner, targeted serums, eye and lip care, hydrating moisturizer, and SPF protection. Ideal for improving dull skin, congestion, and uneven texture, leaving the skin smoother, clearer, and radiant.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=113","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=114","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Dermaplaning","name":"VITALIS Precision Dermaplaning Treatment","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=114","description":"A gentle yet highly effective exfoliation treatment designed to instantly reveal smoother, brighter, and more radiant skin. Using a sterile medical-grade blade, dermaplaning removes dead skin cells and fine facial hair, helping refine texture and enhance product absorption. Skin appears softer, more luminous, and makeup applies more smoothly. Ideal before special events or anytime your skin needs an immediate glow.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=114","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Facial Massage","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=115","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Relaxing Facial Massage","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=115","description":"A calming treatment designed to melt away stress, ease facial tension, and promote a sense of overall well-being. Your esthetician uses gentle, rhythmic massage techniques along the face, neck, and décolleté to improve circulation, encourage lymphatic drainage, and relieve tight muscles that can contribute to jaw tension and headaches. Nourishing oils and light pressure help soften the skin, enhance natural radiance, and support a healthy glow, while focused movements around the eyes, temples, and scalp help quiet the mind and calm the nervous system. Ideal as a stand-alone escape or added to any skincare service.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=115","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=116","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Lymphatic Drainage Facial Massage","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=116","description":"A gentle, rhythmic treatment designed to encourage lymph flow, helping to reduce puffiness, support the body's natural detox processes, and promote a clearer, more refined complexion. Your esthetician uses light, precise movements along the face, jawline, neck, and décolleté to stimulate lymphatic pathways, ease fluid retention, and soften areas of tension. The result is a more sculpted, lifted appearance with less facial bloating, especially around the eyes and cheeks, along with improved circulation for a healthy, natural glow. Ideal for those who experience puffiness, congestion, or want a calming, wellness-focused treatment.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=116","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=117","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Radiant Eyes Massage","service_url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=117","description":"A transformative eye treatment designed to revitalize the delicate periorbital area through specialized massage techniques. This results-focused ritual combines relaxation with targeted rejuvenation to address fine lines, eye strain, puffiness, and fluid retention while releasing emotional tension held in the eye area. Using 14 carefully crafted massage movements, this treatment works with the unique muscles, bones, and skin structure surrounding the eyes to promote circulation, reduce visible signs of fatigue, and support long-term eye health, leaving the eye area refreshed, lifted, and visibly brighter.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/service?service_id=117","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Skin Analysis","itemL